NOTICE on scope (added 2026-09-14, see README's "Pretrained Model" and
"License" sections and CLAUDE.md's "Checkpoint license" section for the
full, sourced writeup): "the Software" above refers to this repository's
source code. It does NOT cover the RMVPE model checkpoint that this
package downloads at runtime from
https://github.com/yxlllc/RMVPE/releases/tag/230917. That checkpoint
carries no license grant from any upstream party (verified against
yxlllc/RMVPE and its parent Dream-High/RMVPE) and is tracked separately as
`license = "NOASSERTION"` in `src/rmvpe_infer/config/checkpoints.toml`.

Separately, whether this repository's own vendored architecture files
(`model.py`, `deepunet.py`, etc. — ported from yxlllc/RMVPE, itself a fork
of Dream-High/RMVPE's Apache-2.0-licensed code, confirmed by matching
filenames in both repos) are correctly described by the "MIT License,
Copyright (c) 2023 yxlllc" header above is an open question flagged for a
maintainer decision, not resolved by this notice — see CLAUDE.md.
